      "finding": "Driver setup reports GFX target120500 and cwsr_enable1. Local source maps GC IP12.1.0 to that target; installed module selects its5656-byte cwsr_trap_gfx12_1_0_hex image at the same GC threshold. The entire image is identical to the local generated header array.",
