    {
      "scope": "entry_triggers",
      "finding": "First-level code forwards non-SAVECTX exception/trap conditions: nonmaskable exception mask0xbd0, enabled user/address-watch exceptions, nonzero software TRAP_ID, or single-step trap control. Host/stochastic events have driver feature-mask handling. A pure SAVECTX condition branches to its own save path at0x470.",
